OL,3,GNEWSASwingers club defeats police bid
OL,4,Afor bouncers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "discreet" swingers club has fended
OL,7,Foff a police attempt to force it to
OL,8,Fhave bouncers on its door after arguing
OL,9,Fdoor staff lacked the "specific skill
OL,10,Fset" needed to deal with its customers.
OL,12,FLancashire Police had demanded that, in
OL,13,Freturn for being granted an alcohol
OL,14,Flicence, Club Play in Blackpool should
OL,15,Fhave to have door staff outside.
OL,17,FThe club's owners told Blackpool
OL,18,Flicensing chiefs that such door staff
OL,19,Fwould "lack the specific skill set that
OL,20,Fa personal licence holder, sensitive to
OL,21,Fthe customer and community's specific
OL,22,Fneeds, would have".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
