OL,3,GNEWSASwingers club defeats police bid
OL,4,Afor bouncers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe licensing committee sided with the
OL,7,Fclub, agreeing that as a private
OL,8,Fmembers venue it operated differently
OL,9,Fto other premises.
